    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></math> be a twice differentiable function such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then which of the following statement(s) is (are) TRUE ?",
    "image": null
